{"server":"tw","storyId":"act17side_level_act17side_03_end","groupId":"act17side","stageId":"act17side_03","title":"安靜的步道","storyCode":"SN-3","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act17side/level_act17side_03_end.txt","sourceHash":"813198b544fab1092bd9a56e859b8c0e6dc1340dad62ad6ff46ed9e6f521b9ca","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"自私的鎮民們意圖將喬迪交給審判庭以息事寧人，蒂亞戈只得幫助喬迪逃走。與此同時，溟痕的出現使得卡門、凱爾希與獵人們都警惕起來。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g18_lighthouse_square"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"與報告如出一轍，我很好奇這究竟是一隻怎樣的生物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"npc_10002","isRemote":false,"text":"（警示性的低鳴）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喔喔......別生氣，小傢伙，看來你能聽懂人話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些恐魚的身上有別的寄生物......但我從未在陸地上見過它們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊比利亞人稱之為“溟痕”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大靜謐之後，伊比利亞的沿海居民偶爾會看見海洋發光的現象。最早的一次目擊報告在十七年前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的科研學者認為這是某種浮游生物集中爆發的結果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，機會難得，我想知道阿戈爾人見過這些......令人不安的東西嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿戈爾過去極少見到這樣的現象，但是螢光的植物？科學院富麗堂皇的花園裡從不缺這類觀賞品。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原來阿戈爾人也懂得何為“觀賞”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“溟痕”——唯獨這個命名十分準確，這種現象即是海洋對陸地的觸碰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而這些蔓延的“溟痕”，本質上和我們在鹽風城見到的恐魚別無二致。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喔......你是說，這種自然現象本身亦是“恐魚”的一種生物形式？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"似乎伊比利亞的生物學家們還不夠努力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......情況比預想的複雜，但也不超過最壞的可能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"審判庭所目擊、殺死、捕獲的恐魚種類幾乎每個月都在變化。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而最快的一次發生在三號海岸線，只經過了四五個日落之後，我們面對的敵人就幾乎面目全非。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"海洋正在侵襲陸地，如我所說的那樣，以它自己的方式。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"現在，我要去救助羅德島的幹員。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我同你一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"不必，你和獵人們儘快掃清威脅是最有效的辦法。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我以為伊比利亞會更謹慎地對待她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希是一個必須謹慎對待的對象，但現在，我們有更明確的敵人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你打算怎麼做，阿戈爾的執政官？讓我們繼續為阿戈爾的傲慢爭執？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"十分鐘。我將解決所有的麻煩，並和我的獵人們會合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之後我們再來商議如何前往那座燈塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我便留在這裡，這座禮拜堂已經失去律法許久，好在有人把它擦亮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它將是這場戰爭中唯一的光芒。伊比利亞的審判庭駐守於此，只我一人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g16_lighthouse_street"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，發生什麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬆懈的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_462_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蒂、蒂亞戈！你上哪去了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬆懈的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_462_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些深海教徒突然出現了！還有怪物，好多怪物！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬆懈的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_462_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......而且......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且什麼？他們為什麼在襲擊城鎮？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿瑪雅......阿瑪雅呢？這些怪物傷害你們了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬆懈的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_462_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們......他們......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬆懈的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_462_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們沒有隨便傷害別人，他們只是在和......一位......審判官戰鬥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬆懈的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_462_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有人去審判庭告密！蒂亞戈！真的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬆懈的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_462_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們在廣場上發現那隻怪物的屍體沒多久，審判官就出現了，現在想來，說不定就是他們幹的......啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？叔叔......啊，女士，下午好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們臉色怎麼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喬迪，跟我來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"叔叔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別出聲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬆懈的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_462_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蒂、蒂亞戈，真的不是我們幹的......我們跑得再快，也不可能在這麼短的時間裡找到審判庭呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我知道。現在我們要先保護好喬迪，必須把事情解釋清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可能是有人之前去的，一個星期前，一個月前，誰知道呢。邪教徒的流言蜚語已經傳播這麼久了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬆懈的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_462_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不、不是！起碼不是我！也不是我的丈夫！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難道是胡安？他們被審判庭發現了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬆懈的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_462_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬆懈的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_462_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道......胡安是深海教會的人？你什麼時候知道的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喬迪！走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬆懈的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_462_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蒂亞戈！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬆懈的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_462_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......他走遠了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警惕的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_459_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別理他，鎮上情況怎麼樣了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬆懈的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_462_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不、不知道，那個審判官和那些外來者在和怪物們打鬥，我們幫不上忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警惕的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_459_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁......等審判官解決了這些怪物，他就會來審判我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬆懈的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_462_1","isRemote":false,"text":"應、應該不會吧......等等，你在想什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警惕的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_459_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個審判官最好和那些怪物同歸於盡......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬆懈的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_462_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在說什麼！呸呸呸！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警惕的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_459_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看，這麼多年來，沒聽說幾次工人們被恐魚傷害的消息......倒是審判庭，給我們造成了多大的傷害？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬆懈的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_462_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但、但是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警惕的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_459_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等到審判庭反應過來，你怎麼向他們證明自己不是深海教徒中的一員？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬆懈的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_462_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那我們怎麼辦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警惕的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_459_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......如果那個審判官真能幹掉這麼多恐魚......那我們......得把最可疑的人押給審判庭，才能洗清嫌疑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警惕的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_459_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比如，一個與深海教會有牽連的阿戈爾人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g17_lighthouse_alley"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐魚","speakerId":"avg_npc_457_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"殿後的教徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......其他人，順利撤離。但是，阿瑪雅，不見蹤影。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"殿后的教徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除了審判官，還有深海獵人，我只從阿瑪雅的隻言片語裡聽說過她們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"殿后的教徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但這裡是陸地，她們沒有那個審判官難纏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"殿后的教徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"找出阿瑪雅，帶走她，然後拖住那些深海獵人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"殿后的教徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧。其他的兄弟姐妹已經慘遭毒手，我們將是最後一批，絕不能讓審判庭殘害更多同胞。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐魚","speakerId":"avg_npc_457_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（附和地扭頭）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutryinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喬迪，快！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好、好的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（街上怎麼被破壞成了這樣......那些......那些也是恐魚？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是審判庭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說不定來的還是個大審判官，隻身一人不帶隊伍，就敢來尋找深海教徒的老巢，那他不會是盞省油的燈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然格蘭法洛出現了恐魚和那些邪教徒，那再怎麼辯解也無濟於事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拿好，孩子，還有你父親留下的燈，都拿好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你長大了，喬迪·方塔納羅薩，所以我把所有事情都告訴了你，這是你擁抱新生活的最後機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......這麼多年我一直都想對你這麼說，告訴你全部真相，盡可能勸你離開，只是我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，蒂亞戈叔叔......你就像是我的父親，格蘭法洛是我們的家。離開這裡......我就會失去所有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你遲早是要離開的。年輕人都想著離開，你倒是個例外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了。我陪你一起走，恐魚是種很危險的東西，但我知道怎麼對付它們。只有現在，我們能從審判官的眼皮底下溜出去......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼聲音？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......門那邊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......嗯？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你們......你們！恐魚不吃人！你們吃起人來倒是俐落......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說話啊！皮特！曼努埃爾！是你們在外面！海草一樣的懦夫——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蒂、蒂亞戈叔叔，怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們把門堵死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？可是，呃，為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼？因為你是阿戈爾人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們肯定把這裡圍住了，我們上閣樓，從房頂離開。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g16_lighthouse_street"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我，認識你嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"勞倫緹娜......看看你的樣子，那身修女服呢？那身修女服多適合你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，你找到了你的歸宿，你被其他深海獵人找到了，現在她們想帶你回家，對嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"勞倫緹娜......勞倫緹娜是我的名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也是萬物之主的名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萬物之主是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海洋，或是能代表海洋的事物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的精神狀態不太對勁，你不該這麼......啊，你清醒過？比如，殺死昆圖斯的時候？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"昆......圖斯......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你接觸過一次海洋，但是沒有立刻前往阿戈爾？我以為你們總是歸心似箭的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又或者......陸地上還有人能夠引導你們，能夠替你們出謀劃策，徐徐圖之？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"勞倫緹娜，我們為什麼要在這個情況下相遇？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的手，很冰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們曾無話不談的，真的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是現在......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"幽靈鯊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......等你回想起我的名字，如果你還記得此刻，就來找我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已經暗暗下過決心，如果你真的能清醒地找到我，我就告訴你所有的真相。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再會了，勞倫緹娜。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......那個人是誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不認識......她......她似乎認識我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗅不到她的氣味，起碼她不是昆圖斯那樣的海嗣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"沒空管她了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"把恐魚處理乾淨，我們去和二隊長會合。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g17_lighthouse_alley"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堵著門的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_459_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，這附近沒有恐魚出沒吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幫忙的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_462_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒、沒有......這附近只能找到怪物的屍體，安靜得很。是不是審判庭已經把怪物全解決了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堵著門的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_459_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那更好，來幫忙。我們得把他們鎖在裡面，喂，誰去找審判官？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幫忙的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_462_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好、好......已經堵死了！可是這裡明明一團糟，我們為什麼要這樣對待蒂亞戈鎮長？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堵著門的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_459_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等事情不糟了，審判官的劍就架在我們的脖子上了——你去看看禮拜堂那邊怎麼樣了，然後把審判庭的人喊過來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幫忙的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_462_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我去？可是萬一還有怪物藏在哪裡，或者......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幫忙的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_462_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？房頂上怎麼有人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堵著門的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_459_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊——？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堵著門的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_459_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是喬迪和蒂亞戈！他們逃走了！快追！快追！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g16_lighthouse_street"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跑，跑起來孩子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我知道了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"往鎮外跑，不要讓審判官發現你，也不要讓那群沒良心的抓到你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈啊......哈啊......接著跑，跑出城鎮，去北方，北方有一個信使驛站，也許還能用——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在你——哈啊、哈啊——包裡放了錢，你得去其他城市，你得去其他國家！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我知道！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喬迪！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在聽！"},{"type":"narration","text":"蒂亞戈放慢了腳步。\n他看著這個茫然的阿戈爾年輕人，拼命在街道上奔跑的背影。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跑，別回頭！一直跑！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像這樣......孩子。就這樣離開......別回頭。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"追來的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"別讓他們跑出鎮子！把那個阿戈爾人交給審判庭！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你說得對，喬迪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡是我們的家。我們花再多時間，再怎麼抱怨也改變不了這一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（阿戈爾語）一路順風，孩子！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"追來的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_459_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蒂亞戈！那個阿戈爾人呢——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"懦夫！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"追來的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_459_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......你發什麼瘋！該死的！審判庭會把我們都當成異端的！就像過去那樣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怕審判庭勝過怕那些恐魚嗎？！你們怕自己的同胞勝過怕那些怪物嗎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"追來的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_459_1","isRemote":false,"text":"審判庭已經毀了我們一次，你還想經歷第二次嗎！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......呸，軟弱的拳頭......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"追來的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_459_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你——等、等等，那是什麼......那些東西......它們還在！？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐魚","speakerId":"avg_npc_457_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（詭異的窸窣聲）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"追來的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_459_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，得、得趕緊回禮拜堂，審判官身邊才是安全的——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈啊，這拳送給懦夫！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"追來的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_459_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——呸，咳咳咳，你瘋了？！你看不見那些恐魚嗎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恐魚有什麼可怕的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是恐魚吃掉了格蘭法洛嗎？不，是你們這些人......你們比大靜謐更可怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們的自私與冷漠將憐憫拆骨剝皮，你們用天性粉飾自己的懦弱，把災禍歸咎於阿戈爾人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"追來的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_459_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——不不不，這些怪物，它們靠近了——我才不想和你這個瘋子多話！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，貪生怕死的懦夫，馬琳被帶走的時候，阿戈爾同僚們被帶走的時候，你們就站在懲戒軍的旗子底下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"兇手！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"追來的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_459_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"追來的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_459_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——蒂亞戈，你只是在很久以前愛上了那個活潑的阿戈爾女人而已！別指望所有人陪你發瘋！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來啊，懦夫，來啊，我要打得你滿地找牙！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐魚","speakerId":"avg_npc_457_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（尖銳的呼吸聲）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g26_dusk_wild"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈啊......哈啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蒂亞戈......蒂亞戈叔叔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......哈啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蒂亞戈叔叔——？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哈啊......怎麼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我得回去......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（阿戈爾語）站住，阿戈爾人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，是、是！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你就是格蘭法洛最後的阿戈爾人，你就是布雷奧甘的後裔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什......什麼？布雷什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恐魚會殺死你，審判庭會監禁你，跟我來，我需要你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你也是他們的一員？那些，呃，恐魚的指使者？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不！我在尋找一段消逝的傳奇，即使是過去的科學院也為之側目。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但他留下的最重要的寶物既不是燈塔，也不是浮誇的大船，而是他的後裔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也許是你。你就是我最後的線索。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道你在說什麼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你的父母是做什麼的？你的祖父母是做什麼的？那個叫蒂亞戈的工頭不是你的生父。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的父母......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們......為了伊比利亞之眼，失蹤了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......很不幸，年輕人。但我必須殘忍地指出，這種不幸是今天你能夠拯救阿戈爾的契機。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跟我來，我不想對同胞動粗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我不知道你什麼意思，這麼突然，莫名其妙......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跟我來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？！發生什麼事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"安靜點好兄弟，我可是在救你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"煙霧裝置，小聰明......早知道就不該放走你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"帶著他逃跑有什麼意義？你什麼都不知道，黎博利。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"說得對，阿戈爾人，這裡有很多謎團。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"而你，違反律法之徒，若不能給出回答，就不得離開這裡半步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"希望你對此有所認識。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_storehouse"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......沒追過來，太好了，挑在審判官靠近的時機把你帶走真是正確的選擇......他們應該不會打起來吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......回過神來了沒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，欸，抱歉......我......我得回鎮上看看......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然鎮上的恐魚被消滅得差不多了，但是氛圍不太對，我也聯繫不上凱爾希醫生，不太建議你冒這個險喔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再說了......你這是打算離開了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我......不是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是聽說審判官來了小鎮，蒂亞戈叔叔擔心我被帶走，所以......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......審判庭啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那剛才那個人抓你做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，可以不說的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先給我點時間，我琢磨一下到底是自己潛回小鎮找凱爾希醫生，還是先找條路把你送出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我陪你回去，極境先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......確定嗎？你的那個叔叔肯定想方設法才讓你逃出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......如果真有那麼多審判庭的人手在靠近，那我也逃不出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的使命值得你獻出生命嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？什、什麼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你甚至都沒有一個清晰的目的，只是懷著對使命的憧憬就要回到格蘭法洛？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別開玩笑了兄弟，我建議......你離開這裡，帶著其他不想被捲進來的鎮民，越快越好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們不是在森林裡露營，然後遇到了一群源石蟲的襲擊——我不想這麼說，但我覺得普通人幫不上忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是隱隱覺得......或者我......也許還有什麼使命沒有完成。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我從小在這裡長大，聽著那些傳說，看著海岸線，閱讀著父母留下的筆記。我不想以這種形式告別這裡......我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是把這裡當做自己的故鄉啊......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_003_kalts","aliases":["凱爾希"]},{"speakerId":"char_263_skadi","aliases":["斯卡蒂"]}]}
